WEBVTT

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:58.530
Yuzuyu...

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:05.040
Yuzuyu, what shall we eat today?

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.680
What do you wanna eat, Mama?

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.780
I... think I want to eat shellfish.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:16.840
Mama?

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.760
You like them too, right?

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:27.530
I... can't see your face, Mama!

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:12.130
Oh, Yuzuyu-chan, you're awake.

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:20.640
You taking an afternoon nap is fine... but why does Kippei have to sleep with you?

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.510
And he could at least sleep in his own room...

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.050
What a bother!

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:53.620
I had a dream about my mama earlier.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:54.940
A dream?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.150
What kind?

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:06.460
I... think I want to eat shellfish.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.170
A dream about food.

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:16.760
Food?

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:21.130
How can we delve into a dream about food?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:25.860
I was surprised.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:32.490
It'd been a while since we heard about "Mama".

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:38.040
There it is!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.420
Hey! Hey! Read me this one today!

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.860
Aren't those too small for you?

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.270
No!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.150
Pervert!

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:57.640
Well... I guess so...

00:04:58.470 --> 00:04:59.760
What're you doing!?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.240
More importantly, did you learn that at kindergarten?

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.580
Marika-chan said it.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.720
You're certainly growing up.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.140
How about you change into another pair.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.060
You have bigger ones, right?

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.110
It's fine. I'll wear this.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:18.970
Why?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.930
Mama made these for me a long time ago.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.200
So...

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:28.550
Doesn't it hurt?

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.740
It looks really tight.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:32.810
It hurts, but...

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.810
Then don't push yourself and just change!

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:36.800
Take that!

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.550
Don't tickle me! That's not fair!

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.030
Change!

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.860
Come on, Yuzuyu!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.060
What're you doing?

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.700
What'd you do, Kippei!?

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:56.090
Y-Yuzuyu... S-Sorry!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:57.680
I didn't do it on purpose.

00:05:58.510 --> 00:05:59.230
If you stretch it...

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.330
S-Sorry!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.730
The pajamas were made by her mother?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.480
Is that true?

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.700
Now it seems she'll never take them off...

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:30.400
What're you doing!?

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:33.890
Like I said, they're small...

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:35.800
Let's just let it be...

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:38.560
Even if they're too tight, let her sleep in them for now.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:42.740
Kippei, I'll lend you some money, so... go buy new ones tomorrow!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.540
Mom, it's not that simple of a problem!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.350
That's right.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.000
Yuzuyu-chan isn't that stupid.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:55.870
Oh? Whenever I bought you guys new ones, you always forgot the old ones right away!

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:57.820
I guess that mean you're stupid.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.040
Even though that was a joke...

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:03.740
A joke?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.840
You should give up those dumb jokes, Mom.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:09.700
What's wrong with having a backup pair?

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:11.480
You've sure grown up!

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:13.640
I get it.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:24.330
Well, buy some cute ones!

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.090
I wonder if I really can.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.400
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.340
Yuzuyu.

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:31.260
Where're you going?

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.840
Out for a little shopping.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.420
I wanna go, too!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.000
Why don't you look after house?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.240
No! I wanna go, too!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.910
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:53.930
Errands! Errands! Errands are fun!

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:57.460
Errands with Kippei-onii-chan!

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:09.460
The children's clothes these days are amazing!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.780
Are you looking for something?

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.470
Umm... Pajamas for her.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.160
Pajamas?

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:27.250
The types that are popular now are ones with flower patterns, and also one with cute animal shapes.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.890
These are okay, right, Yuzuyu?

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.720
They're not that good.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:45.180
Though they're different from ones your mom made for you...

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.910
Sorry for ruining them.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:50.880
For now, wanna get them?

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:52.820
You don't have a backup pair.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:05.840
Oh! How cute!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.680
Yeah! It's super cute!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.880
I wanna wear these, too!

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.580
What're you saying, silly?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.700
These are Yuzuyu-chan's!

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:25.490
Yuzuyu-chan, don't you like these?

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:27.850
What a waste!

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:30.200
I'll take 'em!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:31.690
You can...

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.490
I'll... wear my mom's.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.660
But... they're already small, and you can't wear them now, right?

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.060
No... I can still wear them.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.030
Yuzuyu-chan, you mustn't be selfish.

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.410
You're getting bigger every day.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.350
You can't keep wearing the things you've been wearing until now.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:58.590
So...

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:00.260
I'm not being selfish!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.050
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:02.260
It's fine!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:05.320
Kippei and I were both wrong to rush you...

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.620
Sis! Yuzuyu wants the ones her mother made.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:16.020
Sorry for suddenly taking you out pajama shopping.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:17.430
Sorry, sorry.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:38.970
What was wrong earlier?

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:41.450
Saying such harsh things to Yuzuyu-chan...

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:46.150
Since she doesn't have a mother... I wonder if it's okay to make her say she's selfish.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:50.820
And... I wonder if it's really for her own good...

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:52.760
But you know...

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.000
You said so, right?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.620
I did?

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:02.010
That when you got us new ones, we were fools who forgot about the old ones right away.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.330
That's... Well...

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.450
Were we really like that?

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:13.020
If your clothes got too little, and were made to wear the new ones without any questions...

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.300
But... everyday, when your mom gets angry at you...

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.220
You'd forget that the old ones even exist.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:27.090
I wonder if we really can't replace her mother...

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.040
What's wrong?

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:57.960
It's strange.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.870
It won't go like I want it to.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.840
Jeez!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.520
I give up!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:12.320
This... isn't something a guy should be doing!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:17.750
What am I saying?

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:20.610
What're you yelling about?

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:24.860
'Morning.

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:26.260
Oh, My!

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:40.610
I somehow thought you were my sister... but it's you, Kokoro-chan.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.350
Did you cut your hair?

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:42.950
Yep.

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:44.340
Just a bit.

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:46.740
It's cute.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.210
Thanks.

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:51.580
What're you doing now?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:58.000
Well... I want to fix this... cleanly.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:02.400
Aren't you sewing this backwards?

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.970
When you get so close, my heart races.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.570
Is this Yuzuyu-chan's?

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.870
Yeah... I'm the one who did it.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.580
What'd you do to rip it this badly?

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.410
Hey. Lie down.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:27.310
Seriously?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:28.480
Yep.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.270
Have you calmed down?

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:40.160
I'm not calm at all...

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.060
What happened?

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.860
Yuzuyu... loves me, right?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:49.900
Yes.

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:59.350
Even though I'm always with her... she suddenly remembered her mother...

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:06.090
It's really starting to bother me...

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.390
It really can't be helped.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:10.570
I guess it's because she's her mother.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.000
Sorry.

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:24.360
It's okay... I'm already used to being alone.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.080
Are you upset?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:27.430
No.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:31.450
Is Yuzuyu at the kindergarten now?

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:32.250
Yes.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:37.290
I wonder if she hates me...

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:39.160
Why?

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:40.930
Why do you say "why"?

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:47.930
You're the type of guy who can ask without a thought.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.570
What? You're upset?

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.390
I'm fine.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.580
You really are angry!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.310
I'm not angry.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.710
Really, Kokoro-chan?

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:00.230
Yep.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.140
Yuzuyu... who's that?

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.760
It's you!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:23.260
Hello?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.640
Ah, Katakura-san!

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.900
About picking her up today?

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:30.240
Okay.

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:31.990
Okay, I understand.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:36.880
Ding-Dong! Next is Asou Station!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.660
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:51.360
Yes?

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.500
They're here to get you.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.610
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.230
Well...

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:06.190
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:13.350
I just got a phone call from Kippei-san; his friend Tokunaga-san is going to pick you up today.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.740
I'm going home with Kokoro-onee-chan?

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:27.640
Yeah.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:33.000
Why won't Kippei-san come!?

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.940
Moreover, why did that dark girl come!?

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.360
His girlfriend?

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:41.690
Possibly.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.620
I remember seeing her once before when he came to get Yuzuyu.

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.440
It's something of a shock...

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:51.510
I no longer feel excited about him coming from tomorrow on.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:11.440
Ki-

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:13.280
What?

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:15.950
Where's Kippei-onii-chan?

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.260
Kippei... suddenly got a stomach ache.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:26.190
Stomach ache?

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:26.990
Yep.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:34.580
Hey.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:38.940
Should I go pick up Yuzuyu-chan?

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:40.870
Wanna go together?

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:43.730
No, you don't come.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:45.680
Why?

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.890
No... I guess not.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.620
What's wrong?

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.000
Nothing...

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:57.220
What?

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.730
Is there something on my face?

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:00.870
No...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:08.170
Bye.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:13.280
Kokoro-chan...

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:14.440
I...

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:15.660
What's wrong?

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:18.210
Hurry up and go get Yuzuyu-chan.

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:23.680
Owwww!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:24.420
What's wrong?

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:27.170
My stomach suddenly... I need to use the bathroom!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:32.430
I... probably can't go get Yuzuyu.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.090
So... please go in my place!

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:37.090
But...

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:38.670
This is bad!

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.110
H-Hey...

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:43.350
A-Anyway... Please take care of picking up Yuzuyu!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.930
And so, I came to get you in his place.

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:56.790
Are you worried about him?

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:57.610
Yep.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.290
I'm sure he's all right.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:01.310
Okay.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:06.860
I think he'll get home first, and come out to meet you.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:09.800
Okay.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:14.160
I'm home.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.910
Huh? What? Are you alone?

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:19.270
Where's Yuzuyu-chan?

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:21.660
Yeah... She'll come home a little later.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.030
Later?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.330
What do you mean?

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:25.620
Nothing much...

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.240
Do you want to go in?

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.270
No...

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:43.650
Let's go.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:17.590
A mountain.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:19.380
Yep!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.440
Make it into a big mountain.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:22.860
Okay!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.590
What're you doing, Kokoro-onee-chan?

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.560
I was thinking that, sand whispers when it falls.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:49.670
Yeah.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:56.030
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.500
What?

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:00.700
I heard your pajamas got ripped.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:04.280
Kippei was working really hard to fix them today.

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:17.890
They're already too small...

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:20.280
But you want to wear them, right?

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.520
Because your mother made them... you treasure them, right?

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:32.130
But...

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:37.940
I feel like I'm gonna forget about Mama!

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:41.790
Yuzuyu-chan...

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.440
I forgot Mama's face already!

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:50.200
I already forgot her!

00:24:01.260 --> 00:24:04.380
Reiko! What're you doing wearing that!?

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:05.390
Are you traveling?

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:06.660
Yeah.

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:09.560
Where're you going all of a sudden?

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:12.710
Just somewhere... I'll be back soon, I think.

00:24:13.420 --> 00:24:13.960
Probably.

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:20.020
Kippei's girlfriend?

00:24:20.190 --> 00:24:20.610
Yep!

00:24:20.840 --> 00:24:21.560
Kokoro-chin!

00:24:22.730 --> 00:24:24.580
Kokoro-chin... Don't you have something else to call her?

00:24:25.590 --> 00:24:27.700
Kokoro-chan, if you're ever lonely, stop by!

00:24:28.720 --> 00:24:31.030
Yuzuyu-chan, if you hang your mother's picture from your neck like this...

00:24:32.220 --> 00:24:33.420
Yay! We can be together all the time!

00:24:34.210 --> 00:24:35.740
Yay! Let's all three of us sleep together!

00:24:35.940 --> 00:24:36.750
NO!

00:24:37.450 --> 00:24:39.390
Final Episode of Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:39.860 --> 00:24:42.510
I love you all!

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:44.050
Yuzuyu!

00:24:44.050 --> 00:24:47.510
Kippei-onii-chan! Let's stay together forever!
